#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QGroupBox, gbDomainSpecific)
#: cookies/kcookiespolicies.ui:123
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"To add a new policy, simply click on the <b>Add...</b> button and supply the "
"necessary information. To change an existing policy, use the <b>Change...</"
"b> button and choose the new policy from the policy dialog box. Clicking on "
"the <b>Delete</b> button will remove the currently selected policy causing "
"the default policy setting to be used for that domain, whereas <b>Delete "
"All</b> will remove all the site specific policies.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"Da biste dodali novu smernicu, kliknite na <b>Nova...</b> i unesite potrebne "
"podatke. Za izmenu postojeće smernice, kliknite na <b>Izmeni...</b> i "
"izaberite novu smernicu u dijalogu. Klikom na dugme <b>Obriši</b> uklanjate "
"trenutno izabranu smernicu, čime će se za taj domen koristiti podrazumevana "
"smernica, dok <b>Obriši sve</b> uklanja sve posebne smernice za sajtove.\n"
"</qt>"

