#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enables the execution of scripts written in ECMA-Script (also known as "
"JavaScript) that can be contained in HTML pages. Note that, as with any "
"browser, enabling scripting languages can be a security problem."
msgstr ""
"Omogućava izvršavanje skripti napisanih u JavaScriptu, koje HTML stranice "
"mogu sadržati. Imajte u vidu da, kao i kod bilo kog drugog pregledača, "
"dozvoljavanje aktivnog sadržaja može biti bezbednosni problem."

# rewrite-msgid: /default policy setting/default policy/
#: jsopts.cpp:70
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can set specific JavaScript policies for any particular host or "
"domain. To add a new policy, simply click the <i>New...</i> button and "
"supply the necessary information requested by the dialog box. To change an "
"existing policy, click on the <i>Change...</i> button and choose the new "
"policy from the policy dialog box. Clicking on the <i>Delete</i> button will "
"remove the selected policy causing the default policy setting to be used for "
"that domain. The <i>Import</i> and <i>Export</i> button allows you to easily "
"share your policies with other people by allowing you to save and retrieve "
"them from a zipped file."
msgstr ""
"Ovde možete podesiti posebne smernice za JavaScript za određene domaćine i "
"domene. Da biste dodali novu smernicu, kliknite na dugme <i>Nova...</i> i "
"unesite podatke koje dijalog zatraži. Da biste izmenili postojeću smernicu, "
"kliknite na <i>Izmeni...</i> i izaberite smernicu sa spiska. Klikom na dugme "
"<i>Obriši</i> uklanjate izabranu smernicu, čime domen pod njom spada na "
"podrazumevanu smernicu. Dugmadima <i>Uvezi...</i> i <i>Izvezi...</i> možete "
"lako deliti svoje smernice sa drugima, tako što ćete ih upisivati i "
"dobavljati iz fajla arhive."

#: jsopts.cpp:80
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>This box contains the domains and hosts you have set a specific "
"JavaScript policy for. This policy will be used instead of the default "
"policy for enabling or disabling JavaScript on pages sent by these domains "
"or hosts.</p><p>Select a policy and use the controls on the right to modify "
"it.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ovaj prozor sadrži domene i domaćine kojima ste postavili posebnu "
"smernicu za JavaScript. Ova smernica će biti korišćena umesto podrazumevane "
"za aktiviranje i deaktiviranje JavaScript apleta na stranicama koje ovi "
"domeni ili domaćini šalju.</p><p>Izaberite smernicu i upotrebite kontrole "
"desno da je izmenite.</p>"

#: jsopts.cpp:87
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Click this button to choose the file that contains the JavaScript policies. "
"These policies will be merged with the existing ones. Duplicate entries are "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ovde da izaberete fajl koji sadrži smernice za JavaScript. Učitane "
"smernice će biti stopljene sa postojećima. U slučaju da ista smernica već "
"postoji, nova će biti ignorisana."

#: jsopts.cpp:90
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Click this button to save the JavaScript policy to a zipped file. The file, "
"named <b>javascript_policy.tgz</b>, will be saved to a location of your "
"choice."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ovde da sačuvate smernicu za JavaScript kao kompresovan fajl, po "
"imenu <b>javascript_policy.tgz</b>, i smešten na lokaciji po vašem izboru."

#: jsopts.cpp:96
#, kde-format
msgid "Global JavaScript Policies"
msgstr "Globalne smernice JavaScripta"

#: jspolicies.cpp:161
#, kde-format
msgid "Open new windows:"
msgstr "Otvaranje novih prozora:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:169 jspolicies.cpp:223 jspolicies.cpp:260 jspolicies.cpp:297
#: jspolicies.cpp:337
#, kde-format
msgid "Use global"
msgstr "Koristi globalno"

#: jspolicies.cpp:170 jspolicies.cpp:224 jspolicies.cpp:261 jspolicies.cpp:298
#: jspolicies.cpp:338
#, kde-format
msgid "Use setting from global policy."
msgstr "Koristi postavke iz globalne smernice."

# @option:radio Global JavaScript Policies
#: jspolicies.cpp:176 jspolicies.cpp:230 jspolicies.cpp:267 jspolicies.cpp:304
#: jspolicies.cpp:344
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow"
msgstr "dozvoli"

#: jspolicies.cpp:177
#, kde-format
msgid "Accept all popup window requests."
msgstr "Prihvati sve zahteve za iskačućim prozorima."

#: jspolicies.cpp:183
#, kde-format
msgid "Prompt every time a popup window is requested."
msgstr "Pitaj svaki put kada je zahtevan iskačući prozor."

# @option:radio Global JavaScript Policies
#: jspolicies.cpp:188
#, kde-format
msgid "Deny"
msgstr "odbij"

#: jspolicies.cpp:189
#, kde-format
msgid "Reject all popup window requests."
msgstr "Odbaci sve zahteve za iskačućim prozorima."

# @option:radio Global JavaScript Policies
#: jspolicies.cpp:194
#, kde-format
msgid "Smart"
msgstr "pametno"

#: jspolicies.cpp:195
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Accept popup window requests only when links are activated through an "
"explicit mouse click or keyboard operation."
msgstr ""
"Prihvati zahteve za iskačućim prozorima samo kada su veze aktivirane "
"izričitim klikom miša ili preko tastature."

#: jspolicies.cpp:202
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If you disable this, Konqueror will stop interpreting the <i>window.open()</"
"i> JavaScript command. This is useful if you regularly visit sites that make "
"extensive use of this command to pop up ad banners.<br /><br /><b>Note:</b> "
"Disabling this option might also break certain sites that require <i>window."
"open()</i> for proper operation. Use this feature carefully."
msgstr ""
"<p>Ako isključite ovo, K‑osvajač neće izvršavati JavaScript naredbu "
"<tt>window.open()</tt>. Veoma korisno ako često posećujete sajtove koji puno "
"koriste iskačuće prozore za prikaz reklama.</p><p><b>Napomena:</b> Zabrana "
"ove naredbe može onemogućiti rad pojedinih sajtova kojima je neophodna za "
"pravilno funkcionisanje. Stoga koristite pažljivo ovu mogućnost.</p>"

#: jspolicies.cpp:216
#, kde-format
msgid "Resize window:"
msgstr "Promena veličine prozora:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:231
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow scripts to change the window size."
msgstr "Dozvoli skriptama da promene veličinu prozora."

# @option:radio Global JavaScript Policies
#: jspolicies.cpp:236 jspolicies.cpp:273 jspolicies.cpp:310 jspolicies.cpp:350
#, kde-format
msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "ignoriši"

#: jspolicies.cpp:237
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the window size. The web page will "
"<i>think</i> it changed the size but the actual window is not affected."
msgstr ""
"Ignoriši pokušaje skripti da promene veličinu prozora. Veb stranice će "
"<i>misliti</i> da je veličina promenjena, dok u stvari nije."

#: jspolicies.cpp:244
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Some websites change the window size on their own by using <i>window."
"resizeBy()</i> or <i>window.resizeTo()</i>. This option specifies the "
"treatment of such attempts."
msgstr ""
"Neki veb sajtovi samostalno menjaju veličinu prozora naredbama <tt>window."
"resizeBy()</tt> ili <tt>window.resizeTo()</tt>. Ovom opcijom određujete kako "
"će se obrađivati takvi pokušaji."

#: jspolicies.cpp:253
#, kde-format
msgid "Move window:"
msgstr "Pomeranje prozora:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:268
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow scripts to change the window position."
msgstr "Dozvoli skriptama da promene položaj prozora."

#: jspolicies.cpp:274
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the window position. The web page will "
"<i>think</i> it moved the window but the actual position is not affected."
msgstr ""
"Ignoriši pokušaje skripti da promene položaj prozora. Veb stranice će "
"<i>misliti</i> da je prozor pomeren, dok u stvari nije."

#: jspolicies.cpp:281
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Some websites change the window position on their own by using <i>window."
"moveBy()</i> or <i>window.moveTo()</i>. This option specifies the treatment "
"of such attempts."
msgstr ""
"Neki veb sajtovi samostalno menjaju položaj prozora naredbama <tt>window."
"moveBy()</tt> ili <tt>window.moveTo()</tt>. Ovom opcijom određujete kako će "
"se obrađivati takvi pokušaji."

#: jspolicies.cpp:290
#, kde-format
msgid "Focus window:"
msgstr "Fokusiranje prozora:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:305
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow scripts to focus the window."
msgstr "Dozvoli skriptama da fokusiraju prozor."

#: jspolicies.cpp:311
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to focus the window. The web page will <i>think</"
"i> it brought the focus to the window but the actual focus will remain "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Ignoriši pokušaje skripti da fokusiraju prozor. Veb stranice će <i>misliti</"
"i> da je prozor fokusiran, dok u stvari nije."

# skip-rule: t-action
#: jspolicies.cpp:319
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Some websites set the focus to their browser window on their own by using "
"<i>window.focus()</i>. This usually leads to the window being moved to the "
"front interrupting whatever action the user was dedicated to at that time. "
"This option specifies the treatment of such attempts."
msgstr ""
"Neki veb sajtovi samostalno fokusiraju svoj prozor pregledača naredbom "
"<tt>window.focus()</tt>. Ovo obično znači da će prozor biti pomeren ispred, "
"prekidajući posao kojim se trenutno bavite. Ovom opcijom određujete kako će "
"se obrađivati takvi pokušaji."

#: jspolicies.cpp:330
#, kde-format
msgid "Modify status bar text:"
msgstr "Menjanje teksta trake stanja:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:345
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow scripts to change the text of the status bar."
msgstr "Dozvoli skriptama da izmene tekst u traci stanja."

#: jspolicies.cpp:351
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the status bar text. The web page will "
"<i>think</i> it changed the text but the actual text will remain unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Ignoriši pokušaje skripti da promene tekst u traci stanja. Veb stranice će "
"<i>misliti</i> da je tekst promenjen, dok u stvari nije."

#: jspolicies.cpp:359
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Some websites change the status bar text by setting <i>window.status</i> or "
"<i>window.defaultStatus</i>, thus sometimes preventing displaying the real "
"URLs of hyperlinks. This option specifies the treatment of such attempts."
msgstr ""
"Neki veb sajtovi menjaju tekst u traci stanja postavljajući promenljive "
"<tt>window.status</tt> ili <tt>window.defaultStatus</tt>, čime mogu sprečiti "
"očitavanje stvarnih URL‑ova hiperveza. Ovom opcijom određujete šta se čini "
"sa takvim pokušajima."

#: policydlg.cpp:30
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Domain-Specific Policies"
msgstr "Posebne smernice po domenu"

#: policydlg.cpp:47
#, kde-format
msgid "&Host or domain name:"
msgstr "&Ime domaćina ili domena:"

#: policydlg.cpp:55
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter the name of a host (like www.kde.org) or a domain, starting with a dot "
"(like .kde.org or .org)"
msgstr ""
"Unesite ime domaćina (npr. www.kde.org) ili ime domena, koje počinje tačkom "
"(npr. .kde.org ili .org)"

#: policydlg.cpp:139
#, kde-format
msgid "You must first enter a domain name."
msgstr "Prvo morate uneti ime domena."

#. i18n: ectx: property (windowTitle), widget (QWidget, TabsOptions)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:14
#, kde-format
msgid "Tabs Behavior"
msgstr "Ponašanje jezičaka"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_4)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:20
#, kde-format
msgid "Aspect"
msgstr "Izgled"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pDynamicTabbarHide)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:26
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This will display the tab bar only if there are two or more tabs. Otherwise "
"it will always be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Ovo će prikazivati traku sa jezičcima samo ukoliko postoje dva ili više "
"jezička. Inače, traka će se uvek prikazivati."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pDynamicTabbarHide)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:29
#, kde-format
msgid "Hide the tab bar when only one tab is open"
msgstr "Sakrij traku sa jezičcima kada ima samo jedan"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:38
#, kde-format
msgid "Tab bar position"
msgstr "Položaj trake sa jezičcima"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, tabbarPosition)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:48
#, kde-format
msgid "Choose where to display the tabs bar"
msgstr "Izaberite gde će se prikazivati traka sa jezičcima"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (QComboBox, tabbarPosition)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:52
#, kde-format
msgid "Above contents"
msgstr "iznad sadržaja"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (QComboBox, tabbarPosition)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:57
#, kde-format
msgid "Below contents"
msgstr "ispod sadržaja"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (QComboBox, tabbarPosition)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:62
#, kde-format
msgid "Left of contents"
msgstr "levo od sadržaja"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (QComboBox, tabbarPosition)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:67
#, kde-format
msgid "Right of contents"
msgstr "desno od sadržaja"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:93
#, kde-format
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Upotreba"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pShowMMBInTabs)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:99
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This will open a new tab instead of a new window in various situations, such "
"as choosing a link or a folder with the middle mouse button."
msgstr ""
"U nekim situacijama, kao što je klik na vezu ili fasciklu srednjim dugmetom "
"miša, ovim će se otvoriti novi jezičak umesto novog prozora."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pShowMMBInTabs)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:102
#, kde-format
msgid "Open &links in new tab instead of in new window"
msgstr "Otvori &vezu u novom jezičku umesto u novom prozoru"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pPopupsWithinTabs)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:109
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Whether or not JavaScript popups if allowed shall open in a new tab or in a "
"new window."
msgstr ""
"Da li će se JavaScript iskačući prozori otvarati u novom jezičku ili novom "
"prozoru."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pPopupsWithinTabs)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:112
#, kde-format
msgid "Open pop&ups in new tab instead of in new window"
msgstr "&Iskačući prozori u novom jezičku umesto prozoru"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pKonquerorTabforExternalURL)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:119
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When you click a URL in another KDE program or call kfmclient to open a URL, "
"the current desktop will be searched for a non-minimized Konqueror and, if "
"found, the URL opened as a new tab within it. Otherwise a new Konqueror "
"window will be opened with the required URL."
msgstr ""
"<qt>Kada kliknete na URL u nekom drugom KDE programu, ili pozovete "
"<tt>kfmclient</tt> da biste otvorili URL, i ukoliko je na površi pokrenut "
"K‑osvajač, URL će biti otvoren kao novi jezičak unutar njega. U suprotnom, "
"biće otvoren novi prozor K‑osvajača sa traženim URL‑om.</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pKonquerorTabforExternalURL)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:122
#, kde-format
msgid "Open as tab in existing Konqueror when URL is called externally"
msgstr "Otvori spoljašnji URL kao jezičak u postojećem K‑osvajaču"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_2)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:132
#, kde-format
msgid "New Tab Behavior"
msgstr "Ponašanje novih jezičaka"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pNewTabsInBackground)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:138
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>This will open a new tab in the background, instead of "
"in the foreground.</p><p>Press <span style=\" font-family:'Fira Code';"
"\">shift</span> when opening a new tab to reverse this behavior</p></body></"
"html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Ovo će otvarati novi jezičak u pozadini, umesto u "
"prvom planu.</p><p>Pritisnite <span style=\" font-family:'Fira Code';"
"\">Shift</span> pri otvaranju novog jezička da biste obrnuli ovo ponašanje</"
"p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pNewTabsInBackground)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:141
#, kde-format
msgid "O&pen new tabs in the background"
msgstr "Otvori novi jezičak u &pozadini"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pOpenAfterCurrentPage)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:148
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This will open a new tab opened from a page after the current tab, instead "
"of after the last tab."
msgstr "Ovo će otvoriti novi jezičak odmah iza tekućeg, umesto iza poslednjeg."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pOpenAfterCurrentPage)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:151
#, kde-format
msgid "Open &new tab after current tab"
msgstr "Otvori &novi jezičak posle tekućeg"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, m_newTabEmpty)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:158
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Whether to leave the new tab empty or not. If this is "
"unchecked, the new tab will load the same URL loaded when creating a new "
"window</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Da li novi jezičak ostaviti prazan ili ne. Ako ovo "
"nije uključeno, u novom jezičku će se učitati isti URL koji se učitava pri "
"stvaranju novog prozora</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_newTabEmpty)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:161
#, kde-format
msgid "Leave new tab empty"
msgstr "Ostavi novi jezičak prazan"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_3)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:171
#, kde-format
msgid "Closing"
msgstr "Zatvaranje"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pPermanentCloseButton)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:177
#, kde-format
msgid "This will display close buttons inside each tab."
msgstr "Ovim će se unutar jezičaka nalaziti dugme za zatvaranje."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pPermanentCloseButton)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:180
#, kde-format
msgid "&Show close button on tabs"
msgstr "&Dugme za zatvaranje na jezičcima"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pMiddleClickClose)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:187
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When you click on a tab using the middle mouse button or mouse wheel, it "
"will close that tab."
msgstr ""
"Kliknete li na jezičak srednjim dugmetom miša (ili točkićem), on će se "
"zatvoriti."

# >> @option:check
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pMiddleClickClose)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:190
#, kde-format
msgid "Middle-click on a tab to close it"
msgstr "Srednji klik na jezičak zatvara ga"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pTabConfirm)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:197
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This will ask you whether you are sure you want to close a window when it "
"has multiple tabs opened in it."
msgstr ""
"Ovo će vas upitati da li zaista želite da zatvorite prozor kada je u njemu "
"otvoreno više jezičaka."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pTabConfirm)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:200
#, kde-format
msgid "Confirm &when closing windows with multiple tabs"
msgstr "&Potvrdi zatvaranje prozora sa više jezičaka"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pTabCloseActivatePrevious)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:207
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When checking this the previous used or opened tab will be activated when "
"you close the current active tab instead of the one right to the current tab."
msgstr ""
"Ako uključite ovo, kada zatvorite tekući jezičak, umesto prvog desnog biće "
"aktiviran poslednji prethodno korišćeni ili otvoreni jezičak."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pTabCloseActivatePrevious)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:210
#, kde-format
msgid "Activate previously used tab when closing the current tab"
msgstr "&Na prethodno korišćeni jezičak pri zatvaranju tekućeg"

